<p>A decree announced Monday assigned the duties of defense minister to Mali’s military leader and president, Assimi Goïta, after Defense Minister Sadio Camara was killed in coordinated attacks on April 25, state television reported. Le Figaro said the attacks targeted several large cities.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/ihm_21U1syqAR7sva1xmaPd1NTQE8MsDeUMS4yqQD6dR6dRChplSZpWMBiXCNPL2IY9-BNRiQa69gvvgyucKmTQVPZql5Sq7JAdiOVKhaWrmKa5T_vdgt3d74lTwEZCD_XpB_0y0k_Bci2wDwyymW4tqLSFbZsX9IK0FZ-Mv-UKFPMvBw79OaEHvG6FPKawZ4U79k-E' alt='Malian President Assimi Goïta attends the funeral of Gen. Sadio Camara, the defense minister.' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Attack site: Le Figaro reported Camara was killed in Kati, a junta stronghold near Bamako.</li><li>Deputy named: Telexpresse reported Gen. Oumar Diarra was appointed as deputy after Goïta took charge of the defense ministry.</li><li>Public visibility: Togo Actualite said Goïta had been absent from public view before reappearing after the attacks.</li><li>Attack method: AllAfrica said Camara died in a suspected suicide bombing during the coordinated assault.</li></ul><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>Malian state television: The broadcaster attributed the April 25 attacks to al Qaeda-linked militants and Tuareg separatists. (<a href='https://www.straitstimes.com/world/mali-leader-goita-assumes-role-of-defence-minister-after-attacks-state-media-says'>The Straits Times</a>)</li><li>Le Figaro: The French newspaper characterized Goïta’s decision to assign himself the defense ministry as a strengthening of his power. (<a href='https://www.lefigaro.fr/international/le-chef-de-la-junte-au-mali-assimi-goita-renforce-son-pouvoir-en-s-attribuant-la-fonction-de-ministre-de-la-defense-20260505'>Le Figaro</a>)</li><li>Togo Actualite: The Togolese site said Bamako had not collapsed after the attacks and described a slow effort to reorganize the military response. (<a href='https://togoactualite.com/mali-securite-bamako-plie-mais-ne-rompt-pas/'>Togo Actualite</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://abcnews.com/International/wireStory/malis-junta-leader-takes-defense-ministry-after-minister-132642216'>Mali&#x27;s junta leader takes over defense ministry after the minister was killed in militant attacks</a> - abcnews.com</li><li><a href='https://allafrica.com/stories/202605050097.html'>Mali: Mali&#x27;s Leader Assumes Defense Role After Minister Was Killed in Bombing</a> - allafrica.com</li><li><a href='https://www.straitstimes.com/world/mali-leader-goita-assumes-role-of-defence-minister-after-attacks-state-media-says'>Mali leader Goita assumes role of defence minister after attacks, state media says</a> - straitstimes.com</li><li><a href='https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/c8r8jr7x8mlo'>Mali junta leader names himself defence minister after predecessor killed</a> - bbc.com</li><li><a href='http://www.africanews.com/2026/05/04/mali-junta-chief-to-take-over-killed-defence-ministers-role/'>Mali junta chief to take over killed defence minister&#x27;s role</a> - africanews.com</li><li><a href='https://www.lefigaro.fr/international/le-chef-de-la-junte-au-mali-assimi-goita-renforce-son-pouvoir-en-s-attribuant-la-fonction-de-ministre-de-la-defense-20260505'>Le chef de la junte au Mali, Assimi Goïta, renforce son pouvoir en s’attribuant la fonction de ministre de la Défense</a> - lefigaro.fr</li><li><a href='https://qiraatafrican.com/38691/%d8%b2%d8%b9%d9%8a%d9%85-%d9%85%d8%a7%d9%84%d9%8a-%d8%a3%d8%b3%d9%8a%d9%85%d9%8a-%d8%ba%d9%88%d9%8a%d8%aa%d8%a7-%d9%8a%d8%aa%d9%88%d9%84%d9%89-%d9%85%d9%86%d8%b5%d8%a8-%d9%88%d8%b2%d9%8a%d8%b1-%d8%a7/'>زعيم مالي أسيمي غويتا يتولى منصب وزير الدفاع</a> - qiraatafrican.com</li><li><a href='https://telexpresse.com/471473.html'>مالي: غويتا يتولى مهام وزير الدفاع بعد مقتل ساديو كامارا</a> - telexpresse.com</li><li><a href='https://togoactualite.com/mali-securite-bamako-plie-mais-ne-rompt-pas/'>Mali-Sécurité : Bamako plie mais ne rompt pas.</a> - togoactuali